<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>FinMate — Role-Based Money Management for Individuals and Teams</title>
    <meta name="description" content="FinMate is a role-based personal finance and team system. Track expenses, plan budgets, set savings goals, and manage teams with scoped permissions. Built and deployed to Vercel.">
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/images/favicon/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,600;9..144,700;9..144,900&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --paper: #f6f2ea;
            --paper-deep: #eee8db;
            --ink: #1b1a17;
            --ink-soft: #3a382f;
            --muted: #6b6559;
            --line: #d8d0bf;
            --green: #1f6b3c;
            --green-deep: #14472a;
            --green-light: #e7efe6;
            --amber: #b98900;
            --red: #a3372c;
            --white: #fffdf8;
            --radius: 2px;
            --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(27, 26, 23, 0.06), 0 8px 24px rgba(27, 26, 23, 0.06);
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

        html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

        body {
            font-family: 'Public Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
            color: var(--ink);
            background: var(--paper);
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-size: 16px;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        h1, h2, h3, h4, h5 {
            font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1.08;
            letter-spacing: -0.01em;
            color: var(--ink);
        }

        p { color: var(--ink-soft); }

        a { color: var(--green); text-decoration: none; }
        a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

        .wrap { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 28px; }

        /* Header — solid, decisive, no glass blur */
        .page-header {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 50;
            background: var(--paper);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        }
        .header-inner {
            max-width: 1120px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 18px 28px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }
        .brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--ink);
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }
        .brand:hover { text-decoration: none; }
        .brand-mark {
            width: 30px; height: 30px;
            border: 2px solid var(--ink);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: grid; place-items: center;
            font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--green);
        }
        .nav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 26px; }
        .nav-links a:not(.btn) {
            color: var(--ink-soft);
            font-size: 0.93rem;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .nav-links a:not(.btn):hover { color: var(--green); text-decoration: none; }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.92rem;
            line-height: 1;
            padding: 13px 20px;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.15s ease, transform 0.12s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .btn:active { transform: translateY(1px); }
        .btn-solid { background: var(--green); color: var(--white); }
        .btn-solid:hover { background: var(--green-deep); color: var(--white); text-decoration: none; }
        .btn-ink { background: var(--ink); color: var(--white); }
        .btn-ink:hover { background: #000; color: var(--white); text-decoration: none; }
        .btn-outline {
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--ink);
            border: 1px solid var(--ink);
        }
        .btn-outline:hover { background: var(--ink); color: var(--white); text-decoration: none; }

        /* Hero — asymmetric, left-aligned, no gradient */
        .hero {
            padding: 96px 0 72px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at 85% 12%, rgba(31,107,60,0.06), transparent 42%),
                var(--paper);
        }
        .hero-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 5fr 6fr;
            gap: 64px;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .kicker {
            display: inline-block;
            font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.12em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--green);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            background: var(--white);
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            margin-bottom: 26px;
        }
        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5.2vw, 4.1rem);
            font-weight: 900;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
            max-width: 14ch;
        }
        .hero h1 .accent {
            font-style: italic;
            color: var(--green);
        }
        .hero-lede {
            font-size: 1.12rem;
            color: var(--ink-soft);
            max-width: 46ch;
            margin-bottom: 34px;
        }
        .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 40px; }
        .hero-rule {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 8px 24px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
            padding-top: 22px;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            color: var(--muted);
        }
        .hero-rule span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; }
        .hero-rule i { color: var(--green); font-size: 0.8rem; }

        /* Hero data panel — honest product surface */
        .panel {
            background: var(--white);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
        }
        .data-panel { position: relative; }
        .data-panel-head {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
            background: var(--paper-deep);
        }
        .data-panel-title { font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
        .data-live { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 0.76rem; color: var(--green); font-weight: 600; }
        .data-live::before { content: ''; width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--green); }
        .ledger { padding: 10px 20px 20px; font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif; }
        .ledger .row {
            display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px;
            padding: 11px 0; border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--line); font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        .ledger .row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .ledger .k { color: var(--muted); }
        .ledger .v { font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); }
        .ledger .tag { background: var(--green-light); color: var(--green-deep); padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: var(--radius); font-size: 0.74rem; font-weight: 600; }
        .data-foot {
            display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px;
            padding: 18px 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
            font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--muted);
        }
        .data-foot b { color: var(--ink); }

        /* Section shell */
        .section { padding: 96px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
        .section-alt { background: var(--paper-deep); }
        .section-head {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr;
            gap: 40px;
            align-items: end;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }
        .section-head .title { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.4vw, 2.7rem); font-weight: 800; max-width: 14ch; }
        .section-head .sub { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.05rem; max-width: 46ch; }
        .section-number {
            font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
            font-style: italic;
            color: var(--green);
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        /* Features — definition list, not 3 equal cards */
        .features {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 1px;
            background: var(--line);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
        }
        .feat {
            background: var(--white);
            padding: 34px 36px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 40px 1fr;
            gap: 18px;
            align-items: start;
        }
        .feat.tall { grid-row: span 2; background: var(--ink); }
        .feat.tall h3 { color: var(--white); }
        .feat.tall p { color: #c8c4b8; }
        .feat .num { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--green); line-height: 1; }
        .feat.tall .num { color: var(--amber); }
        .feat h3 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .feat p { font-size: 0.96rem; }
        .feat ul { list-style: none; margin-top: 14px; }
        .feat li { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #c8c4b8; padding: 5px 0; display: flex; gap: 9px; align-items: baseline; }
        .feat li::before { content: '—'; color: var(--amber); }

        /* Photo band — real people, real captions */
        .photos { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; }
        .photos figure { margin: 0; background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); overflow: hidden; }
        .photos img { width: 100%; height: 340px; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
        .photos figcaption { padding: 16px 20px 18px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }
        .photos figcaption .cap { display: block; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 4px; }
        .photos figcaption .src { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--muted); }
        .photos figcaption .src a { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: underline; }
        @media (max-width: 720px) { .photos { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

        /* Roles — the honest five */
        .roles {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
        }
        .role {
            background: var(--white);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-top: 3px solid var(--green);
            padding: 28px;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
        }
        .role .r-title { font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 4px; }
        .role .r-scope { font-size: 0.78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--green); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 14px; }
        .role p { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }
        .role:nth-child(4) { grid-column: 1 / span 1; }
        .role:nth-child(5) { grid-column: 2 / span 1; }

        /* Stack — the real tech, no filler */
        .stack {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 1px;
            background: var(--line);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
        }
        .tech {
            background: var(--white);
            padding: 26px 24px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 6px;
        }
        .tech .layer { font-size: 0.72rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }
        .tech .name { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 600; }

        /* Access — free, honest, asymmetric panels (not 3-tier pricing) */
        .access {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
            gap: 20px;
            align-items: stretch;
        }
        .access-card {
            background: var(--white);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
        }
        .access-card.dark {
            background: var(--ink);
            color: var(--white);
            border: none;
        }
        .access-card.dark h3 { color: var(--white); }
        .access-card.dark p { color: #c8c4b8; }
        .access-card h3 { font-size: 1.7rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .access-card .price { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--green); margin-bottom: 6px; }
        .access-card.dark .price { color: var(--amber); }
        .access-card .sub { color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 26px; }
        .access ul { list-style: none; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .access li { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px; padding: 7px 0; font-size: 0.96rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }
        .access.dark-contact { color: var(--white); }
        .access li i { width: 14px; color: var(--green); font-size: 0.8rem; }
        .access-card.dark li { color: #c8c4b8; }

        .note {
            margin-top: 34px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--muted);
            border-left: 3px solid var(--amber);
            padding-left: 16px;
        }

        /* FAQ — two-column editorial */
        .faq { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0 48px; }
        .faq-item { padding: 24px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
        .faq-item h4 { /* JS toggles open state */ }
        .faq-q {
            width: 100%; text-align: left; background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer;
            font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 1.18rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink);
            display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 4px 0;
        }
        .faq-q i { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--green); transition: transform 0.2s ease; }
        .faq-item.open .faq-q i { transform: rotate(45deg); }
        .faq-a { max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; transition: max-height 0.25s ease; }
        .faq-a p { padding-top: 12px; font-size: 0.96rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }

        /* CTA */
        .cta {
            padding: 110px 0;
            background: var(--ink);
            color: var(--white);
            text-align: left;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        }
        .cta .wrap { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 40px; align-items: center; }
        .cta h2 { color: var(--white); font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem); font-weight: 800; max-width: 12ch; }
        .cta p { color: #c8c4b8; margin-top: 16px; max-width: 46ch; }
        .cta-side { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px; align-items: flex-start; }
        .cta-figure { width: 320px; max-width: 100%; border: 1px solid #2a2822; border-radius: var(--radius); overflow: hidden; }
        .cta-figure img { width: 100%; height: 200px; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
        .cta-figure figcaption { padding: 12px 16px; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #8f8a7e; background: #201f1b; }
        @media (max-width: 620px) { .cta-figure { width: 100%; } }

        /* Footer */
        .page-footer { padding: 64px 0 40px; background: var(--ink); color: #8f8a7e; }
        .footer-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 40px; }
        .page-footer .brand { color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 14px; }
        .page-footer .brand .brand-mark { border-color: var(--white); color: var(--amber); }
        .page-footer p.about { font-size: 0.9rem; max-width: 34ch; }
        .footer-col h5 { font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #c8c4b8; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .footer-col a { display: block; color: #8f8a7e; font-size: 0.9rem; padding: 5px 0; }
        .footer-col a:hover { color: var(--amber); text-decoration: none; }
        .footer-base { margin-top: 48px; border-top: 1px solid #2a2822; padding-top: 22px; font-size: 0.82rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

        /* Entrance (reserved, only for hero, honors reduced motion) */
        .hero-grid > * { animation: rise 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) both; }
        .hero-grid > :nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.12s; }
        @keyframes rise { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(14px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
            .hero-grid > * { animation: none; }
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 980px) {
            .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 44px; }
            .section-head { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 14px; }
            .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .feat.tall { grid-row: auto; }
            .roles { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
            .role:nth-child(5) { grid-column: auto; }
            .stack { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
            .access { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .faq { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0; }
            .cta .wrap { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; }
            .nav-links { display: none; }
            .header-inner { padding: 16px 20px; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 560px) {
            .roles { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .stack { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .wrap { padding: 0 20px; }
            .section { padding: 70px 0; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="page-header">
        <div class="header-inner">
            <a class="brand" href="/">
                <span class="brand-mark">F</span> FinMate
            </a>
            <nav class="nav-links">
                <a href="#features">App</a>
                <a href="#roles">Roles</a>
                <a href="#stack">Stack</a>
                <a href="#access">Access</a>
                <a href="/auth/login">Sign in</a>
                <a class="btn btn-solid" href="/auth/register">Create account</a>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="wrap hero-grid">
            <div>
                <span class="kicker">Role-based money management</span>
                <h1>Expense tracking and budgets, <span class="accent">scoped by role.</span></h1>
                <p class="hero-lede">
                    FinMate is a single system where individuals, teams, and administrators
                    manage expenses, budgets, savings goals, and planned purchases — each role
                    seeing exactly what it's allowed to.
                </p>
                <div class="hero-actions">
                    <a class="btn btn-ink" href="/auth/register">Create a free account</a>
                    <a class="btn btn-outline" href="#features">See what's inside</a>
                </div>
                <div class="hero-rule">
                    <span><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Free to explore</span>
                    <span><i class="fas fa-check"></i> 5 roles / 10 tables</span>
                    <span><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Deployed on Vercel</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="panel data-panel" aria-label="FinMate product overview">
                <div class="data-panel-head">
                    <span class="data-panel-title">FINMATE / OVERVIEW</span>
                    <span class="data-live">live</span>
                </div>
                <div class="ledger">
                    <div class="row"><span class="k">Access control</span><span class="v">5 roles</span></div>
                    <div class="row"><span class="k">Route guards</span><span class="v">100%</span></div>
                    <div class="row"><span class="k">Database tables</span><span class="v">10</span></div>
                    <div class="row"><span class="k">Password hashing</span><span class="v tag">bcrypt · 12</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="data-foot">
                    <span><b>Weekly</b> budget</span>
                    <span><b>35,000</b> KES</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Features -->
    <section id="features" class="section">
        <div class="wrap">
            <div class="section-head">
                <div>
                    <div class="section-number">I</div>
                    <h2 class="title">What the app actually does</h2>
                </div>
                <p class="sub">
                    Every feature is built and working — expenses, budgets, savings, planned
                    purchases, and notifications — all enforced through a permission matrix.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="features">
                <div class="feat tall">
                    <span class="num">01</span>
                    <div>
                        <h3>Role-based access control</h3>
                        <p>
                            Five roles each carry a permission set, mapped through a
                            many-to-many schema and enforced by a middleware guard on every route.
                        </p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Super Admin</li>
                            <li>Admin</li>
                            <li>Team Leader</li>
                            <li>Team Member</li>
                            <li>Individual User</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="feat">
                    <span class="num">02</span>
                    <div>
                        <h3>Expense tracking</h3>
                        <p>Add, edit, and delete expenses, categorize them, and filter by date, category, or status.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="feat">
                    <span class="num">03</span>
                    <div>
                        <h3>Budget planning</h3>
                        <p>Weekly, monthly, yearly, or custom periods with active, inactive, and completed states.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="feat">
                    <span class="num">04</span>
                    <div>
                        <h3>Savings goals</h3>
                        <p>Set a target and a target date, then track your progress toward it with clear status.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="feat">
                    <span class="num">05</span>
                    <div>
                        <h3>Planned expenses</h3>
                        <p>Log upcoming purchases through a pending, paid, or cancelled lifecycle.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="feat">
                    <span class="num">06</span>
                    <div>
                        <h3>Notices & teams</h3>
                        <p>Shared team budgets and in-app notifications for expense, budget, and system events.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="feat">
                    <span class="num">07</span>
                    <div>
                        <h3>Dashboards per role</h3>
                        <p>Chart.js breakdowns and budget progress, rendered to match each role's permissions.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Photo band -->
    <section class="section section-alt" aria-label="FinMate in everyday life">
        <div class="wrap">
            <div class="section-head">
                <div>
                    <div class="section-number">·</div>
                    <h2 class="title">Built for the everyday side of money</h2>
                </div>
                <p class="sub">
                    Real budgeting rarely happens in a dashboard vacuum. It happens on a
                    kitchen table, with receipts and a calculator. FinMate is built to sit
                    naturally alongside that.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="photos">
                <figure>
